    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22b815258a963da467bff91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“ZDAL”……\r\n我总算是理解了这个字符代表着什么——\r\n强力的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2224c9ce04a0427ad74d9c37b1f761acbd527f19cc8eac18a51936a6bcc8d74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
