    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:204040a4da0e1d439099b533",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她曾说自己准备进军三后冠路线。\r\n……若是有缘的话，也许你们会在比赛中\r\n相遇吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6114a29caf13af16304242f1b08a1a70f3e57cfabfc29ec4644d0d6ed4852ecf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
