      "uid": "zhcn:85fc8a6441b12b806d9deea1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。\r\n『出道战』完成。\r\n之后，新宇宙要——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe2fa3a98ecc108071cad08c0b0a1e8120af1975f607554218019f57459f04e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
