    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311972d620c087923ada7c3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙正——“追求”着这个。\r\n交流、共感，也就是——相乘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cce469f90eec244f6d77f3e27a973a812941f3d036a71b5b4a6c323172e79f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c60635901d2a70f1e6d0b4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我必须先道歉才行。\r\n身为训练员的我，判断力实在太过迟钝。如果不\r\n是新宇宙的话，可能连这次出道都会变成苦战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2e289458b394f2203e382066d9a401e6cfdc50edc0514e0d45f65daf88ce7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfe1085ac7dbba9f0de2925",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而新宇宙，大概是看了参赛者名单之后，\r\n察觉到危险……这才提议更换比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df59cbe70ba1e493ed5f2b65e01096c706763878aead4d2ef299a03eb50f21a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0a865715fb3db97fb135ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我判断出错依然是不争的事实。\r\n而且，我还不假思索地便采用了她的提议，\r\n没有进行进一步调查……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afdb435195fcecd7eccc0b4f7fe94d24761c83be7c3220ca84c57519a6ac6b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c355dc40bece583c1fd3dda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——与强敌擦肩而过。\r\n如果我对她的理解仅仅保持眼下的程度，\r\n那不知下一次还能不能如此走运……",
      "source_fingerprint": "25716f7f2ae0dc4c07985b028d89a009664dba8bc40dd199da6976f65f8616b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d40208c8b31731ac5e4d4be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会努力更加理解你的话语的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a374ae8676efc9952551f9313e90ceb9325f71bc0f158df2beade8518ad09076",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
