      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我们已经签过训练合约。\r\n然而，我们还远未成为心灵相通的搭档。\r\n既然如此——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d275bd61a2aae60536a193e2e143c2018f0d3502c3b2f8db01e8689f467505ef",
